Release binaries
----------------

The release binaries are built with the QNX Software Development Platform
8.0 under QNX's non-commercial licence (QNX Everywhere). Apart from the C
start-up code the QNX toolchain links into every program and the SDP's build
of zstd (below), they contain no QNX code: at run time they use the QNX
libraries present on the target (libc, libm, libsocket, libcurl, libgcc_s,
libtracelog) and, for the trace input, libtraceparser, which you copy from
your own QNX SDP. QNX software on your target is licensed to you by QNX
under its own terms; rtcollector-qnx gives you no right to it.

The binaries include, statically linked:

- zstd 1.5.0, the QNX SDP's build (BSD licence; licenses/zstd.txt)
- libyaml 0.2.5 (MIT licence; licenses/libyaml.txt)

